<title>EGYPT: Egypt paper firm pays out 1.10 pounds.</title>
<headline>Egypt paper firm pays out 1.10 pounds.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rakta/General Paper Industry said on Thursday it was distributing an annual dividend of 1.10 pounds per share for 1995/6, which ended on June 30.</p>
<p>The dividend compares with 1.00 pound for 1994/5.</p>
<p>The company said in November it made net after-tax profits of 36.82 million pounds ($10.83 million) in 1995/6, against 34.43 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>The dividend was approved at a general assembly last week, the company said.</p>
<p>The company has 10.868 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
